<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Monoprix has 2.5 mln dnrs H1 net.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Monoprix has 2.5 mln dnrs H1 net.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's main retail firm SNMVT-Monoprix on Monday said its net profit for the first half of 1996 amounted to 2.5 million dinars.</p>
<p>Figures for the same period last year were not available for comparison. Net profits in 1995 amounted to 4.79 million dinars.</p>
<p>Privately-owned Monoprix has been listed at the Tunis Stock Exchange since last year when it sold to the public a 10 percent stake in its capital which is now at 18.49 million dinars.</p>
</text>
